600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762840/extras/b3aff9216acb8927c17cc2bd68682859.webm?t=1752747905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762840/extras/b3aff9216acb8927c17cc2bd68682859.mp4?t=1752747905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Careful planning of weapons and armor, skills, and party members is the key to success during brutal fights with rivals of all shapes and sizes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762840/extras/fd510138eba7a1fda6929bd1c52f9b39.avif?t=1752747905\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762840/extras/786864f90d3201e93d65a7504f491e96.avif?t=1752747905\" width=640 height=40 /></span>Your journey is filled with diverse characters, each with a unique role to play in your adventures. Discover allies who offer quests and valuable rewards, enhancing your experience and propelling you toward greatness.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762840/extras/63672f8701c145b4e70f3e3fd81ccde7.avif?t=1752747905\" width=640 height=360 /></span>But be wary, for not everyone you encounter has noble intentions. Some may launch attacks on sight or lure you into traps. Stay vigilant! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762840/extras/ce9bca9124d90a38b933c7900f62cb3a.avif?t=1752747905\" data-has-b